<title>UK: Essen Hypo sets 1.5 billion Ffr 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo sets 1.5 billion Ffr 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following pfandbrief was announced by joint lead managers CCF, CDC and Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN AG</p>
<p>AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    21.AUG.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.062   PAY DATE    21.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.412    SPREAD	+15 bp</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS FR/US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OATS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
